# WSA-Next © 2026 Marek Wesołowski - wesmar
#
# Debuggable builds start a shell on the serial console (system/core/rootdir/init.rc), and
# ActivityManager then posts "Serial console enabled - performance is impacted", which WSA shows
# as a Windows notification after every start. On WSA nobody sits at that console (adb and the
# elevator are the ways in), so it is stopped right after init.rc starts it: same trigger,
# parsed later, so this action runs second.
on init && property:ro.debuggable=1
    stop console
